/**
 * Real LOLA + JPL Horizons site catalog.
 *
 * The data under /public/data was generated by the SUNDIAL pipeline from:
 *   - NASA PGDA LOLA 5 m/px landing-site DEMs (six sites)
 *   - NASA PGDA LOLA 80S 80 m/px regional DEM (far field + Nobile/Haworth)
 *   - NASA/JPL Horizons DE441 apparent topocentric ephemerides
 *
 * No synthetic horizon is presented as LOLA: site.dataQuality always states
 * whether the profile is 5 m/px hybrid, 80 m/px regional or approximate.
 */

